stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Detected: 检测到 .ppt/.pptx/.odp
  Detected --> CheckSoffice: ppt_source_for_display
  CheckSoffice --> CacheHit: 缓存 PDF 存在
  CacheHit --> ShowPDF: /doc-pdf iframe
  CheckSoffice --> Convert: soffice 未执行或过期
  Convert --> ShowPDF: 转换成功写缓存
  Convert --> ExtractText: 转换失败/无 soffice
  ExtractText --> ShowSlides: python-pptx 提取成功
  ExtractText --> DownloadOnly: 也无法提取文本
  ShowPDF --> [*]
  ShowSlides --> [*]
  DownloadOnly --> [*]
